{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/cd7c3a6995f504ca8f3112a4d32c41b8.avif?t=1771982264\" width=920 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey with Yusol as she strives to rebuild her clan and enact justice against those who destroyed it. Follow her as she pursues the evil Yi Chun and unravels the mysteries of the Heaven's Fall Cult. Along the way, she\u2019ll encounter an expansive cast of heroes, each with their own skills and story, who will join her resurgent clan and unite in the fight to defeat Yi Chun and Heaven\u2019s Fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/61aaa1f8f862ce1f2b0d4fea7ff373a6.poster.avif?t=1771982264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/61aaa1f8f862ce1f2b0d4fea7ff373a6.webm?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/61aaa1f8f862ce1f2b0d4fea7ff373a6.mp4?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between turn-based strategy and real-time action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In turn-based mode, all five team members take the battle field to unite for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For real-time action, one designated lead hero fights the various enemies supported by four skill-linked allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/2d4bb905a6b445392e35dc019c16111d.poster.avif?t=1771982264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/2d4bb905a6b445392e35dc019c16111d.webm?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/2d4bb905a6b445392e35dc019c16111d.mp4?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build &amp; grow your 5-hero team to begin your journey. With over 40 heroes to unlock, each with their unique skills &amp; stories, a variety of legendary characters awaits you to join your clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/8253bd5e4bbe56415dd755c65b45765b.poster.avif?t=1771982264\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/8253bd5e4bbe56415dd755c65b45765b.webm?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/8253bd5e4bbe56415dd755c65b45765b.mp4?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this anime-inspired world with majestic vistas, eerie forests, ancient deserts, and mythical dungeons of the Earthen Realm. Each hero models a distinctive look and feel evocative of the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat your foes, master your fighting abilities with a wide array of combinations and skills. With each battle, tailor your team strategically in order to achieve victory across different opponents and environments.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lone Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Solitary Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Power of Cooperation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of Teamwork","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Trusted Problem Solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/a07eacea90d6faf84f3fb45e164201c3351e7158.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/d36171bdb11e375f40a93ba89b470776a293798b.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/c61812714494c772be34226ffd2bec1ec8cae3da.jpg"},{"name":"Duel Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/7268ea9eb1035671a9c5974b888215db13a57d83.jpg"},{"name":"Inner strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616890/7bf1ac554773ca8c9a6208d888ed747dbb17feaf.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616890?t=1771982264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616890?t=1771982