16890/extras/8253bd5e4bbe56415dd755c65b45765b.webm?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/extras/8253bd5e4bbe56415dd755c65b45765b.mp4?t=1771982264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this anime-inspired world with majestic vistas, eerie forests, ancient deserts, and mythical dungeons of the Earthen Realm. Each hero models a distinctive look and feel evocative of the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Tactical Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat your foes, master your fighting abilities with a wide array of combinations and skills. With each battle, tailor your team strategically in order to achieve victory across different opponents and environments.</p>","developers":["NCSOFT"],"ext_user_account_notice":"NC account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616890/60a5e0d12b59e64a40ea6633c50799ebdf9f4674/header.jpg?t=1771982264","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616890/932943606/b4e7f739b9abbc5a14cd13807e4c3320ad26ab29/1770175849/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770176772","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616890/932943606/b4e7f739b9abbc5a14cd13807e